div.p:
Whereas, The preceding convention was approved by the Senate of the United States
                    of Mexico the tenth day of May of the present year, and ratified by me the
                    fourteenth day of the said month;

Whereas, It was likewise approved by the Legislative Assembly of the republic of
                    Guatemala the eighteenth day of April last, and was ratified by the President of
                    the Republic of Guatemala the twenty-ninth day of the same month;
